message: "Please cite this version when using the software, numerical results, or accompanying technical note."
type: software
title: "Black-hole recoil dynamics: central residence and density exposure in a Plummer potential"
authors:
  - family-names: Athota
    given-names: Venkata Hemanth
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/heyyymonth/black-hole-recoil-dynamics"
url: "https://github.com/heyyymonth/black-hole-recoil-dynamics/releases/tag/v0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible collisionless benchmarks for centrally kicked test particles in a
  static, isolated Plummer potential. Includes first central-return times,
  finite-window central residence, density exposure, independent numerical
  checks, and a technical note. No observational data or merger probabilities
  are inferred.
keywords:
  - black-hole recoil
  - stellar dynamics
  - Plummer potential
  - reproducible research
